						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2198.898,
							272.767,
							-1675.343
						],
						"pointId": 300100577
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761590201,
					"content": "In the blink of an eye, you find yourselves standing at the edge of a cliff...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590202,
					"content": "Alright, we're here. This Seelie Court has some really great views, don't you think? See that spot over there? That's the starting point.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590203,
						761590204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590203,
					"content": "...Seelie Court?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590205,
					"content": "Did I use it to get us here faster? You bet I did! These Seelie Courts are connected to the Ley Lines, and nobody really uses them. They're very handy when it comes to traveling about.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590206,
					"content": "Besides, the Seelie and I used to be angels, so we're old colleagues. I'm sure they won't mind me borrowing their homes every once in a while.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590207,
					"content": "There doesn't seem to be anyone else around...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590208,
					"content": "We're early. In but a short while, a bard will come to sing odes of old and call back the thousand winds that wander the ages...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590209,
					"content": "I don't suppose this homework is for...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590210,
					"content": "Shh... Patience. All will be revealed in time. Before long, you will become a single lilting melody ensconced in an ode, and the thousand winds will swirl around you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590211,
					"content": "But before that happens, we should allow it to slumber in peace... Come, let's head to our next location.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590212,
						761590213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590212,
					"content": "Hey, isn't this...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590214,
					"content": "Yes, I read about that in the dictionary. Based on how it ended, you and Lord Barbatos must have played quite a beautiful tune. Such a shame that Barbie couldn't hear a single note.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590215,
					"content": "When Alice heard about it, she laughed so hard her hat nearly fell off. Ahem! How about we head to the next location! Which should be...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590213,
					"content": "Venti and I once performed a duet on that island in the distance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590204,
					"content": "Did you just use it to...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590205
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
