					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761590601,
					"content": "Somewhere new? Hey, isn't this...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590602,
						761590603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590602,
					"content": "Hold on, over there...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590604,
					"content": "No wonder Alice wanted to borrow the lodge key... She said she wanted to set up a tea room, even though I told her I already had one...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590605,
						761590606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590605,
					"content": "So this is a gift from Alice?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590607,
					"content": "It symbolizes \"the completion of guidance,\" \"the end of a journey,\" and \"the fulfillment of prophecy.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590608,
					"content": "You've followed Seelie before, right? Only when a Seelie returns to its Seelie Court does its guidance come to an end.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590609,
					"content": "So, to give this unwelcome homework a clear conclusion, Barbie and Alice must have built a Seelie Court right here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590610,
					"content": "This is the only way for my story to be inscribed among everyone else's without interfering with their own homework.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590611,
					"content": "But you're not a Seelie, are you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590612
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590612,
					"content": "Ah... Uhm, well, we're not all that different. Once upon a time, we were all angels, after all... But that doesn't really matter. What's important is what it symbolizes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590613,
					"content": "It's like writing a novel. As long as the main outline is there, there'll always be a way to flesh out the details so the pieces fall into place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590614,
					"content": "As long as I take my seat, this homework of mine will be officially over...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590615,
					"content": "It's a nice touch, but it feels like... the ending to a story written on the fly. If Anya were here, I'm sure she'd have come up with something more clever...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590616,
						761590617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590616,
					"content": "I see...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590618
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590618,
					"content": "Don't you worry, that's an essential element as well...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590619,
					"content": "Hey, a treasure chest!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590620,
					"content": "Hey, a treasure chest!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590621
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590621,
					"content": "Now this homework's starting to make sense!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590622,
						761590623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590622,
					"content": "So this is what it feels like when the pieces all fall into place...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590624,
					"content": "What did I tell you? It seems like this has been a fruitful little excursion after all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590625,
					"content": "Ahem... And it seems my story has been formally inscribed in the dictionary.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590626,
					"content": "Which means... that today's homework ends here, and also, that there'll be a formal tutor to provide guidance on all future assignments.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590627,
					"content": "...Will there be more chests for those assignments, too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590628
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590628,
					"content": "Well, that depends on what assignments are... assigned.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590629,
					"content": "Personally, I'd love nothing more than to bury chests for people to find by completing their homework. I'd leave clues and watch them enjoy a merry little treasure hunt... Now that would be fun!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590630,
					"content": "*sigh* But Barbie's been keeping a close eye on me, so I'm not sure I'll get the chance...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590623,
					"content": "Guess the outline really is key!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590617,
					"content": "And here was me thinking it would end with a treasure chest...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590618
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590606,
					"content": "But why would she give you a Seelie Court...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590603,
					"content": "There's a huge Seelie Court in here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590604
					]
				}
			]
